    "text": "# CATHAREi Bakery & Sweets\n\nBakery in Qatar with branches in Doha (Salwa Road), Al Wakrah and Al Kharaitiyat.\n\n- [Menu](https://www.catharei.com/menu.html): sweets, cakes and savouries\n- [Arabic sweets](https://www.catharei.com/navigation/Arabic_sweets.html)\n- [Contact and branches](https://www.catharei.com/contact.html)\n- [Delivery](https://www.catharei.com/delivery.html): confirm coverage and timing with the branch\n- [Catering](https://www.catharei.com/catering.html)\n- [Corporate gifting](https://www.catharei.com/corporate-gifting.html)\n- [Blog](https://www.catharei.com/blog)\n\nكاثاري للحلويات والكيك والمعجنات في قطر. الفروع: الدوحة والوكرة والخريطيات.\n"
